## Key findings (this session)

- **Ollama `num_parallel=1` (serial inference)** is THE bottleneck — Arbor never configures it
- **qwen3 thinking mode: 47s for "hi"** — near the 60s advisory timeout. User wants gemma4 instead.
- **ThreadPoolExecutor: 8 threads** on 4-core. Advisory uses default executor. Shadow uses async.
- **Caddy SSE path mismatch** — `/advisory/stream*` never matches (actual path is `/api/advisory/stream*`)
- **Single uvicorn worker** — no worker count configured anywhere
- **PostgreSQL PVC not persistent on DGX** — data lost on every reboot. San needs to fix StorageClass.
- **Jumper pod loses kubectl on restart** — installed at runtime, not baked into image
- **M4 Ollama patch fixed upstream** in kaizen-agents 0.9.2 — `_kaizen_patches.py` is a no-op now
- **Cloudflare error 1010** cuts advisory requests that take >30-100s

